OL,3,ACounter-terror police lead
OL,4,Ainvestigation into major incident near
OL,5,ARAF base, officials say
OL,6,
OL,7,FA spokesperson for the US Air Force -
OL,8,Fwho have used the military base to
OL,9,Fdeploy American bombers during the
OL,10,Fongoing conflict with Iran - says its
OL,11,Fpersonnel "remain vigilant"
OL,13,FThe cordon is a substantial way out of
OL,14,Fthe village and police are armed,
OL,15,Fwrites our reporter from the scene
